WEBVTT

00:10:00.512 --> 00:10:02.222
And if you want to understand that,

00:10:02.222 --> 00:10:05.225
think about one last issue,
which is chocolate.

00:10:05.726 --> 00:10:07.144
Hurray.

00:10:07.144 --> 00:10:12.399
Kit Kats started life a century ago
as a British brown biscuit.

00:10:13.233 --> 00:10:16.153
It then went around
the world as an export,

00:10:16.195 --> 00:10:18.113
turned up in Japan,

00:10:18.155 --> 00:10:21.742
and some local Japanese teenagers,
about 20 years ago,

00:10:21.784 --> 00:10:23.327
started using Kit Kats

00:10:23.327 --> 00:10:25.704
as good-luck tokens for exams.

00:10:25.746 --> 00:10:30.125
And then they started adding in
Japanese flavors like soy sauce,